{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21803","headline":"有鸟二十章 十七 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟名鹞雏，铃子眼睛苍锦襦。\n贵人腕輭怜易臂，奋肘一挥前後呼。\n俊鹘无由拳狡兔，金雕不得擒魅狐。\n文王长在苑中猎，何日非熊休卖屠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}